## What We Are Building

A template-based 3D modular shelf designer (Phase 1 MVP). The project is a monorepo with `packages/core` (types, schemas, templates, utils) and `packages/web` (Next.js 15 App Router + R3F + Zustand + Prisma/SQLite).

This session implemented **Task 8: Auth API Routes** — the four HTTP route handlers that expose the JWT+bcrypt auth system (built in Task 7) as REST endpoints:

- `POST /api/auth/register` — create user, sign JWT, set httpOnly cookie
- `POST /api/auth/login` — verify credentials, sign JWT, set httpOnly cookie
- `POST /api/auth/logout` — delete token cookie
- `GET /api/health` — liveness check

Also fixed a pre-existing bug: `@types/node` was missing from `web/package.json`, causing TypeScript errors on `process.env` across `env.ts`, `prisma.ts`, and the new routes.

