## Decisions Made

- **Logic-level test (not HTTP-layer)** — the auth API test mocks Prisma and tests auth functions directly rather than using NextRequest/NextResponse; HTTP-layer testing deferred to E2E tests in Phase F. Reason: simpler, faster, no Next.js test harness needed.
- **`// @vitest-environment node` on all jose tests** — any test file importing `signToken`/`verifyToken` must have this pragma; jsdom sandboxes Uint8Array, breaking jose's `instanceof` check internally.
- **`issues[0]?.message ?? 'Invalid input'`** — used optional chaining on Zod error message access to avoid potential undefined access.

